c-access` input. Metrics ended with `status: failure` after 14 iterations and recorded no usable coverage or metadata entries.\n\nInspect these preserved logs:\n- `human-intervention-logs/com.sun.xml.ws:httpspi-servlet:4.0.5/gradle-test/gradle-test-2026-10-02T18-41-35-005806Z.log`\n- `human-intervention-logs/com.sun.xml.ws:httpspi-servlet:4.0.5/gradle/generateDynamicAccessCoverageReport-2026-10-02T18-30-21-227464Z.log`\n- `human-intervention-logs/com.sun.xml.ws:httpspi-servlet:4.0.5/issue-requested-metadata/pi.log`\n\nManual next steps:\n1. Rework or replace `DeploymentDescriptorParserTest` so it exercises meaningful public behavior without embedding `WstxInputFactory` during image analysis; do not add build-time initialization arguments.\n2. Regenerate and split the metadata after the test is viable, ensuring the test-only `DeploymentDescriptorParserTest$EchoEndpoint` entry is not shipped as library metadata.\n3. Re-run the coordinate’s full `test` and `generateDynamicAccessCoverageReport` tasks and confirm both native execution and a real coverage report succeed.", "textSignature": "{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0d99e8cce35dcaf5016abffbbfac4487d1826966448529a92e\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}], "api": "openai-codex-responses", "provider": "openai-codex", "model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "usage": {"input": 7486, "output": 1516, "cacheRead": 94208, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 1034, "totalTokens": 103210, "cost": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0}}, "stopReason": "stop", "timestamp": 1790966691446, "responseId": "resp_0d99e8cce35dcaf5016abffba4045887d1b5f7620e1faae579", "rawStopReason": "completed"}}
